sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Supplier topology
  participant WH as Warehouse admin
  participant API as backend-go
  participant FC as Factory admin
  participant PL as Payloader
  participant D as Driver
  participant WH2 as Warehouse receive

  S->>API: PUT topology transfer_mode TRUCK or INTERNAL
  WH->>API: POST supply-request SUBMITTED
  API->>FC: WS SUPPLY_REQUEST_UPDATE + Kafka
  FC->>API: PATCH ACKNOWLEDGED IN_PRODUCTION READY
  FC->>API: PATCH FULFILL

  alt INTERNAL co_locate
    API->>API: FactoryInternalTransfer RECEIVED
    API->>WH2: inventory credit + request FULFILLED
    Note over PL,D: no truck manifest no driver leg
  else TRUCK default
    API->>API: transfer APPROVED + optional supply manifest
    FC->>PL: load scan seal
    PL->>D: driver gate
    D->>WH2: execute leg telemetry
    WH2->>API: receiveTransfer inventory credit
  end

  API->>S: dashboards stock history WS refresh
  API->>WH: SUPPLY_REQUEST_UPDATE FULFILLED
  API->>FC: FACTORY_SUPPLY_REQUEST_UPDATE
